      "date": "2026-01-30T11:32:40.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹52.93 (vs ₹38.66 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹52.93 (up from ₹38.66 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹7.98b (up 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.72b (up 37% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 22% (up from 18% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 21% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
